    {
      "path": "src/MessagePack.Annotations/Attributes.cs",
      "line": 181,
      "description": "GeneratedMessagePackFormatterAttribute.IncludeNonPublicMembers is added as shipped public API with XML docs promising serialization of non-public members, but it is never read in MessagePackGenerator.cs (L31-35) or implemented in GeneratedFormatterCollector.cs (L133, L190), so setting IncludeNonPublicMembers = true silently has no effect.",
      "severity": "high"
