      "description": "Extracting SurrogateType uses 'as INamedTypeSymbol'. If a user passes a non-named type such as typeof(int[]), the cast returns null, silently falling back to contractless mode instead of reporting a diagnostic; open generic surrogates such as typeof(MySurrogate<>) are also not rejected.",
      "severity": "low"
    }
